<title>USA: AT&amp;T NYSE open delayed, shrs poised to freefall.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T NYSE open delayed, shrs poised to freefall.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The start of New York Stock Exchange trade in AT&amp;T Corp shares was delayed Tuesday morning due to an order imbalance, the exchange said.</p>
<p>The shares were poised to fall sharply when trading commenced, with a quote of 51 bid, 53 asked, far below the 57-1/4 NYSE close Monday.</p>
</text>
